  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p>We are The Perfect Underwear — a men's bamboo underwear brand engineered for all-day comfort. Our boxer briefs are made from ultra-soft, naturally antibacterial bamboo with quick-dry panels and a unique design that eliminates ride-ups completely. And we donate 10% of every sale to rebuilding schools for children in Nepal.</p><p><br></p><p>We are looking for passionate affiliates to join our program and earn 10% commission on every sale they generate. With an average order value of $75 and bundles up to 9 packs, there is real earning potential here.</p><p><br></p><p>Here's what you get as an affiliate:</p><p>✅ 10% commission on every sale</p><p>✅ Your own unique tracking link</p><p>✅ Access to product images and marketing materials</p><p>✅ A product you can genuinely stand behind — sustainable, comfortable and purpose-driven</p><p><br></p><p>Our customers love the product and the story behind it. Bamboo underwear is a growing niche with a passionate audience — and with our Nepal charity angle, it's a brand people feel good about buying from.</p><p><br></p><p>Interested? Just reply to this email and I'll get you set up.</p><p><br></p><p>Looking forward to working together!</p><p><br></p><p>Best regards,</p><p>Team TPU</p></div></div>",
